#: ../../tools/progenetix_tools.rst:178 5fd6170b8a8848e6b2ee43fe76180d1a
msgid "**Name**: ``Progenetix_search_individuals``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/progenetix_tools.rst:180 574e05460ac74da695f536daea6bc2dd
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search individuals (patients) in the Progenetix cancer "
"CNV database by NCIt disease ontology code. Returns patient IDs, sex, "
"disease diagnosis, age at onset, and study references. Useful for cohort "
"characterization in cancer genomics studies. Example: NCIT:C9145 returns "
"27 AML patients with sex and age data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/progenetix_tools.rst:184 51d1eabc425c4b6abf19b31934c69421
msgid ""
"``filters`` (string) (required) NCIt ontology code to filter individuals "
"by cancer type. Examples: 'NCIT:C9145' (AML), 'NCIT:C3058' "
"(Glioblastoma), 'NCIT:C4017' (Breast Carcinoma), 'NCIT:C3224' (Melanoma)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/progenetix_tools.rst:187 d42ae20b049b4582b5a46006b9b43d39
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of individuals to return "
"(default: 10)."
msgstr ""

